## Original Content
В Евросоюзе в июле цены на автомобильное топливо и масла для личного транспорта выросли на 16,9% к июлю 2025 года, по данным Eurostat.

## Summary
In July, prices for automotive fuels and oils for personal transport in the European Union increased by 16.9% year-over-year, according to Eurostat data.

## Key Points
- Automotive fuel and oil prices in the EU rose significantly in July.
- The year-over-year price increase was 16.9% compared to July 2025.
- Data was reported by Eurostat, the EU's statistical office.


